!v069!Objetives of the work: - To establish mathedological criteria for small scale mapping of potential erosi¢n in the subtropical region of northwestern Argentina on the basis of geomorphology and visual Landsat interpretation. - To evaluate the applicability of parametrio methods for measurement of soil loss in water erosion surveys. - To determine the type, intensity and future evolution of presently active erosional processes in the study region. - To evaluate the possibility of combining digital processing techniques with conventional surveys methods to estimate gross erosion in fluvial catchments.-
